ant\" does?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["bgm","m9"],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_110","In the legends, the Tyrant waged a bloody war against the Monolith and Novians. Countless died.==W== Darcia's ideas fit those stories far better.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_110","c","014",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"w","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Maybe I fail to live up to the stories.==W== But I intend to conquer Nova my own way.",1,""],["w",1],["mrt",0,"x","014","attention","diantou"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Conquer... Is that really what you want, ==PLAYER_NAME==?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","010","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","Does it matter if it's true?==W== Asking questions like that... Sounds like you're planning to betray Darcia.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"w",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_110","c","007","angry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Betray her? I was never loyal to begin with. If you hadn't messed up our plans...==W== Forget it. The past is the past.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","==PLAYER_NAME==, when you accepted Darcia's terms and claimed the title of Tyrant... I thought I had you pegged. I assumed you were just another hypocrite, chasing power at any cost.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","013","vexation",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","But everything you've done since defies logic.==W== You show kindness to strangers with zero gain for yourself. Frankly, it's ... aberrant.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"